</style></div><main class="main-wrapper"><main class="section is-why-list border-bottom"><div class="w-layout-grid header-layout_component is-partner"><div id="w-node-_432db532-800d-a91b-3775-9ec7751f8a81-0d03577c" class="header-layout_content no-width is-partners"><div class="max-width-large _720"><div class="margin-bottom margin-medium"><h1 class="heading-large-h2">Realize Your Company’s Long-Term Vision on the <br/>Long-Term Stock Exchange</h1></div><div class="flex-vertical gap-32 align-left"><div class="max-width-medium"><div class="text-size-large">Find a community that supports your long-term ambitions and join like-minded leaders committed to creating lasting value.</div></div><div class="flex-horizontal gap-8 is-left is-center"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/65a11e650633a2a3926180ef_Group%2010128854.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/><div>Long-Term Stock Exchange championed by long-term investors.</div></div><a href="#your-leadership" data-wf-native-id-path="84239198-cc73-3cc8-0ec5-366f292468c6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="84239198-cc73-3cc8-0ec5-366f292468c6" class="button w-button">Learn More</a></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_432db532-800d-a91b-3775-9ec7751f8a8d-0d03577c" class="header-layout_image-wrapper is-partners"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/648b3c420753bb9c085c4253_why_list_ill_final.webp" loading="eager" alt="" class="header-layout_image is-full-height height-responsive"/></div></div></main><section class="section border-top padded is-partner"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h4>LTSE’s founding investors</h4></div><div>LTSE is backed by a distinguished group of investors including globally recognized and mission-aligned blue-chip investors.</div></div></div><div class="marquee-horizontal_wrapper"><div class="marquee-horizontal_panel"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-file